body:json {
  {
    "description": "Start here: how the community works",
    "visibility": "public",
    "default_notification_level": "mine"
  }
}

docs {
  Partial update. Fields: name, description, emoji, visibility (public, members or groups), access_groups (access group cuids of a groups space, #1241), posting_policy, space_group_cuid (moves the space to the end of that group, and a groups space is then read by the access groups of the new space group, ADR 0041). default_notification_level (#1475): what the members who did not choose get for this space, all (Everything: discussion spaces only, never a chat space) or mine (Only what is for me); null gives the built-in default back (Everything in a discussion space where only moderators post, Only what is for me elsewhere). The choice of a member always wins. The space resource gives it to the people who manage the spaces only. The type and the slug never change.
}
